OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-run care home "not caring"
OL,4,Asays regulator
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living at a care home run by
OL,7,FLiverpool city council were put at
OL,8,Frisk, and more than 50 safeguarding
OL,9,Fconcerns reported in just six months,
OL,10,Fit has emerged.
OL,12,FThe long list of failures at Brushwood
OL,13,FHouse in Speke were published in a
OL,14,Fdamning report by the Care Quality
OL,15,FCommission after an inspection this
OL,16,Fsummer.
OL,18,FThe home, where 39 people currently
OL,19,Flive, was rated "inadequate" in every
OL,20,Farea by the regulator which concluded,
OL,21,F"this service is not caring".
